{
  "name": "10router-desktop",
  "productName": "10Router",
  "version": "1.0.6",
  "description": "10Router 桌面托盘版 — Electron 托盘壳 + Node sidecar",
  "main": "main.js",
  "author": "techysy",
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win",
    "dist:mac": "electron-builder --mac",
    "dist:dir": "electron-builder --win --dir"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^37.2.0",
    "electron-builder": "^25.1.8"
  },
  "comment_electron": "Electron 37 内置 Node 22.16+:服务的 db 驱动链 better-sqlite3(缺,ABI 不匹配会回退) → node:sqlite(原生可用) → sql.js(已捆绑兜底)。sidecar 直接复用 Electron 二进制(ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1),无需内嵌独立 Node 运行时。",
  "comment_build": "build 对象内不能加自定义注释键(electron-builder 按 API schema 严格校验,未知属性直接报错)。extraResources 说明:cli/app 是 build-cli.js 产出的 Next standalone 包(纯 JS + WASM,平台无关),win/mac 共用同一份,以打包机器平台构建即可。",
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.techysy.10router",
    "productName": "10Router",
    "directories": {
      "output": "dist",
      "buildResources": "."
    },
    "files": [
      "main.js",
      "package.json",
      "icon.ico",
      "icon.png"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "../cli/app",
        "to": "app"
      }
    ],
    "win": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "portable",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "nsis-web",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "icon.ico"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "10Router"
    },
    "portable": {
      "artifactName": "10Router-Portable-${version}.exe"
    },
    "mac": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "dmg",
          "arch": [
            "x64",
            "arm64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "icon.png",
      "category": "public.app-category.developer-tools"
    },
    "dmg": {
      "artifactName": "10Router-${version}-${arch}.dmg"
    },
    "compression": "maximum",
    "nsisWeb": {
      "artifactName": "10Router-Web-Setup-${version}.${ext}",
      "appPackageUrl": "https://github.com/techysy/10router/releases/latest/download",
      "oneClick": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "10Router"
    }
  },
  "allowScripts": {
    "electron@37.10.3": true
  }
}
